        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wi">Wi</ref> 4.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Swæse mæn in leodum ciriclicæs gemanan ungestrodyne þoligen.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Our own men among the people [i.e., native] shall suffer loss of the community of the church without forfeiture of goods.</ab>
